WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:09.200
Browse coaches
Find coaches and their public booking pages. Search by name or link, sort by name, and filter by available booking type.

2
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:18.300
Choose a layout
Switch between List and Cards. Each coach shows the booking options configured for their public page.

3
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:25.700
Preview or share a booking page
Preview opens the public booking page. Copy page link lets you share it. Confirm availability before promising a learner a slot.

4
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:34.900
Add and update a coach
Add coach opens the editor. Enter the coach name and booking URLs, then Save coach. Edit updates an existing entry.

5
00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:45.593
Remove an entry
Remove coach asks for confirmation before deleting a directory entry. Check the coach name and the effect on shared links before confirming.
